# Faneqo product quality

Every feature needs concrete artist or fan value. Domain-specific experience over generic SaaS UI.

Visual tokens and brand: `.cursor/rules/10-faneqo-design.mdc`  
Language + gallery lab: `docs/design/FANEQO_VISUAL_LANGUAGE.md`, `/labs/gallery`

## Experience

- Mobile-first. Desktop-only validation is not complete. Test 320, 360, 375, 390, 414, 430, plus 768 / 1024 / 1280+ where relevant.
- Accessibility: keyboard, focus, contrast, `prefers-reduced-motion`
- Ownership and visibility integrity: attendee galleries, Passport, shares
- Rive for meaning. CSS/Vue for layout and polish. PhotoSwipe for photo physics.

## Design for failure

Ask what happens when it fails (partial uploads, dropped network, duplicate publish, stale provider, job runs twice). Design realistic failure states.

## After a phase

- Performance awareness: query count, N+1, payload, no provider in interactive paths
- Product self-critique
- Up to five improvements, classified DO NOW / NEXT PHASE / LATER / REJECT
- Do not automatically implement discovered ideas
